id: pmc-j6cb
title: Preserve historical schemas and physical tracker roots during release membership verification
description: PR #188 review found that an empty repository-root pathspec fails Git reads and present-day schema rules reject valid historical item blobs. Resolve physical tracker roots and load each tag with its own settings and schema files while preserving strict blob evidence validation.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-10T09:11:30.892Z"
