author: codex
acceptance_criteria: Real root and symlink tracker fixtures pass; historical inline and file-backed custom schemas remain readable after evolution; malformed or out-of-repository historical schema evidence fails closed; complete release gate remains green.
parent: pmc-3jq8
release: 2026.9.10
resolution: Release membership resolves physical tracker roots and validates tagged items with tag-local settings and schema files in isolated snapshots.
expected_result: "Root and symlink trackers work, historical schema evolution does not reject valid evidence, and malformed or escaping schema evidence fails closed."
actual_result: "Real Git regressions and all 475 release-gate tests pass with exact measured coverage, docstrings, package and release validation; consumer full-history generation succeeds."
